    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>2级 杂兵 护卫</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物，人类</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 15，''强韧'' 13，''反射'' 11，''意志'' 11</span><span>''侦查'' +2</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">混混阵势</div>\n<div class=description>在该混混五格内至少有两个其他的人类混混的情况下，它的所有防御获得+2 威能加值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}木棒（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+7vs.AC<br>命中：5 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 14（+3）</span><span>''敏捷'' 11（+1）</span><span>''感知'' 12（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 12（+2）</span><span>''智力'' 9（+0）</span><span>''魅力'' 13（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 木棒</span></div></div>\n</div>",
